# brushed_metal.fmat — the pbr effect, as a material.
#
# Every lit surface takes a GGX highlight from every light (specular.glsl);
# without this effect it is shaded as a rough non-metal. Here the plate is a
# metal, smooth enough for a tight highlight: its diffuse colour goes, and
# the highlight takes the albedo's tint instead. A texture with a <name>_arm
# map (AO / roughness / metal, as Poly Haven ships them) would multiply these
# per texel.
kind: surface
texture: hull_plate
doc: Brushed steel plate. A metal at roughness 0.35; the highlight takes the plate's own colour.
effects:
  - effect: pbr
    roughness: 0.35
    metallic: 1
